{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"Y\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"多处把重心放在暴露喜欢后的尴尬、怕给对方造成负担、怕对方觉得自己太黏，以及如何维持原有相处自在上，使表达心意与被接纳成为一条相对独立的主线。\",\n    \"S06-S09 和 S11 较集中地把失去亲密具体化为对方不再需要自己的陪伴，甚至发展出对自己是否被需要、能否继续陪伴对方的顾虑，容易让这项具体关系顾虑代替更完整的幸福与失去之痛。\",\n    \"S03、S10 等段落较倾向于暂时搁置对未来的担忧，单独享受当下的幸福；幸福与留不住它的痛楚交织得不如 Y 紧密。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"仍然较多地把留不住亲密具体化为对方以后不再需要自己的陪伴，并以对方也需要自己、能从自己身上获得安心来支撑幸福感，略微收窄了 Center 所说的亲密幸福与失去之痛这一整体体验。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"Y 更持续地让幸福本身带着失去的阴影：越享受亲近，越舍不得它过去；越确认彼此需要，越感到未来无法保证。X 则有更多篇幅转向表达心意是否会造成负担、自己是否仍被需要等相邻但更具体的关系问题。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ee101b79-9b8f-415f-9aef-a4e3c7a9c6ec", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T074753959247Z", "elapsed_seconds": 20.079, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T07:48:14.038983+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "373967c597ebe26daeb1e440848443066c89b9cad90ee7c0492f5007c4829207", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_ses